
<#
.SYNOPSIS
    This PowerShell script ensures that the Windows account
    lockout threshold is configured to 3 or fewer invalid
    logon attempts, excluding 0.

.NOTES
    Author          : Sinjin Torga-Eide
    LinkedIn        : https://www.linkedin.com/in/sinjin-torga-eide-674185297
    GitHub          : https://github.com/DatGuy84
    Date Created    : 2026-11-16
    Version         : 1.0
    CVEs            : N/A
    Plugin IDs      : N/A
    STIG-ID         : WN11-AC-000010
    Vulnerability ID: V-253298
    Severity        : Medium (CAT II)
    Documentation   : https://stigaview.com/products/win11/v2r7/WN11-AC-000010/

.TESTED ON
    Date(s) Tested  : 2026-11-16
    Tested By       : Sinjin Torga-Eide
    Systems Tested  : Windows 11 VM 
    PowerShell Ver. : 5.1

.USAGE
    Run PowerShell as Administrator.

    Example:
    PS C:\> .\WN11-AC-000010.ps1

    This script configures the account lockout threshold
    to 3 invalid login attempts.
#>

# STIG WN11-AC-000010 Remediation

# Configure account lockout threshold
net accounts /lockoutthreshold:3

# Verify account lockout policy
net accounts
